{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll start the demo at the entrance of an abandoned amusement park. Explore liminal environments, interact with rides and attractions, find clues, and piece them together. One of the rides will take you to an underground area filled with liminal tunnels, halls, and pools. You'll get to explore four areas in total. No jump scares\u2014just a pure psychological experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are James Anderson, and you've come to the place where your father went missing on the anniversary of his disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777250/extras/Train_Bunker.gif?t=1749203989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your father built an amusement park, he never imagined that so much joy and happiness would end up feeding something sinister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777250/extras/Park.gif?t=1749203989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you're back, in the very same place, and if you're brave enough, you're about to find out what happened\u2014not just to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777250/extras/Bunker.gif?t=1749203989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">His fate won't let you sleep at night. Are you ready to get your last ticket and\u00a0step\u00a0inside?<br><br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liminal intersects cosmic: The game takes place in an odd environment that blends liminal and cosmic features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-driven game: A twist-filled adventure with cosmic horror themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration-driven gameplay: Exploring an abandoned park and underground areas, following clues and building a narrative is central to this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive attractions and rides: Broken rides and attractions inexplicably remain operational, inviting players to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological unease: Narrative in Emotionless: The Last Ticket confuses players, with environmental storytelling and liminal spaces intensifying feelings\u00a0of\u00a0isolation.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/3e6255b8c0b3ee43f01b5538ca02a21b354467af.jpg"},{"name":"Into Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/1ea9fcaa18e703bc021bb6a8369dcc170b44bd26.jpg"},{"name":"Let There Be Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/cfd8e743128d6a9a8fc620e38cebf63f62ac01ec.jpg"},{"name":"Seriously","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/19056b4cdd84de4a236a1d0b0be66514fee08062.jpg"},{"name":"Breaking the Fourth Wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/26f113297277522534efcf5128fcb196a33e43f0.jpg"},{"name":"Hidden Eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/026888148051505b8f13e91f7c8cccae6439deef.jpg"},{"name":"Insomniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/24424c0d218df331bb037ba7a49e387424c6ea92.jpg"},{"name":"No Quack Shall Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777250/b9949a6dbc31d2dabc588e6a4e5c84e13bfe3e0d.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/stor