ass=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you're back, in the very same place, and if you're brave enough, you're about to find out what happened\u2014not just to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777250/extras/Bunker.gif?t=1749203989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">His fate won't let you sleep at night. Are you ready to get your last ticket and\u00a0step\u00a0inside?<br><br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liminal intersects cosmic: The game takes place in an odd environment that blends liminal and cosmic features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-driven game: A twist-filled adventure with cosmic horror themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration-driven gameplay: Exploring an abandoned park and underground areas, following clues and building a narrative is central to this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive attractions and rides: Broken rides and attractions inexplicably remain operational, inviting players to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological unease: Narrative in Emotionless: The Last Ticket confuses players, with environmental storytelling and liminal spaces intensifying feelings\u00a0of\u00a0isolation.</p></li></ul>","developers":["X1 Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3570000","name":"EMOTIONLESS : The Last Ticket"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777250/70290b0c99fb3b209ad2414e41af625dd02de50d/header.jpg?t=1749203989","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146512,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146512/movie480.mp4?t=1748599865","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr